serve these sites over http with nginx.
host shop.example.com:
- / proxies to http://localhost:3000.
- /static serves files from /var/www/shop.
- /bla serves files from /var/xxx/shop.
host blog.example.com:
- /static serves files from /var/y/shop.
host api.example.com:
- /v1 proxies to http://localhost:5000.
